      "content_text": "```python\ndemo = [\n    {\"id\": \"q2\", \"grupo\": \"B\", \"prioridad\": 1, \"marca\": \"08:00\"},\n    {\"id\": \"q1\", \"grupo\": \"A\", \"prioridad\": 1, \"marca\": \"08:00\"},\n    {\"id\": \"q2\", \"grupo\": \"B\", \"prioridad\": 2, \"marca\": \"08:10\"},\n]\nantes = list(demo)\nresultado = asignar_turnos(demo, {\"A\": 1, \"B\": 1})\n```",
      "evidence_id": "ev_249c96141d2ed104b688",
